@startuml UC-07-Belajar-Materi
title Sequence Diagram: Belajar Materi

actor "Users (Learner)" as User
participant "Halaman Detail Materi\ndengan Mode Belajar\n(React)" as UI
participant "POST /api/riwayat-belajar/complete" as API
participant "RiwayatBelajarController" as Controller
participant "RiwayatBelajarService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel RiwayatBelajar,\ntabel Pengguna)" as DB

User -> UI: Mengakses detail materi\ndan masuk mode belajar
activate UI
UI --> User: Menampilkan konten materi\ndengan tombol "Tandai Selesai"
User -> User: Membaca dan mempelajari\nkonten materi
User -> UI: Scroll sampai akhir materi
User -> UI: Klik "Tandai Selesai"
UI -> API: POST /api/riwayat-belajar/complete\n{ idPengguna, idKonten,\ntipeKonten: 'materi' }
activate API
API -> Controller: markComplete()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: completeMateri(data)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM RiwayatBelajar\nWHERE idPengguna = '[userId]'\nAND idKonten = '[materiId]'\nAND tipeKonten = 'materi'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return hasil pengecekan
deactivate DB

alt Belum pernah menyelesaikan
    Service -> Service: Kalkulasi XP\n(base XP = 10)
    Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    activate DB
    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO RiwayatBelajar\n(idPengguna, idKonten, tipeKonten,\nxpDidapat, tanggalSelesai)\nVALUES ('[userId]', '[materiId]',\n'materi', 10, NOW())
    DB --> Service: INSERT success
    Service -> DB: UPDATE Pengguna SET\nxpLearner = xpLearner + 10,\ntotalXP = totalXP + 10\nWHERE idAkun = '[userId]'
    DB --> Service: Return updated user data\n(totalXP baru)
    Service -> Service: Cek threshold rank\nberdasarkan totalXP baru
    
    alt totalXP mencapai threshold baru
        Service -> DB: UPDATE Pengguna SET\nrankPeringkat = '[new_rank]'\nWHERE idAkun = '[userId]'
        DB --> Service: Rank UPDATE success
        Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        DB --> Service: Transaction committed
        deactivate DB
        Service --> Controller: { success: true,\nxpGained: 10, rankUp: true,\nnewRank: 'Bronze' }
        Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
        API --> UI: Response sukses dengan rank up
        UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Selamat! +10 XP Learner"
        UI --> User: Tampilkan modal\n"Rank naik! Anda sekarang Bronze"
        UI -> UI: Update tombol\n"Sudah Diselesaikan" (disabled)
    else totalXP belum mencapai threshold
        Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        activate DB
        DB --> Service: Transaction committed
        deactivate DB
        Service --> Controller: { success: true,\nxpGained: 10, rankUp: false }
        Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
        API --> UI: Response sukses
        UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Selamat! +10 XP Learner"
        UI -> UI: Update tombol\n"Sudah Diselesaikan" (disabled)
    end
    
else Sudah pernah menyelesaikan
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nmessage: "Sudah diselesaikan",\nalreadyCompleted: true }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Response
    UI --> User: Tampilkan pesan\n"Anda sudah menyelesaikan\nmateri ini sebelumnya"
    UI -> UI: Tombol tetap\n"Sudah Diselesaikan" (disabled)
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Exception: Database Error ==

note over DB
  Jika INSERT RiwayatBelajar gagal:
  - ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
  - Tampilkan error
  - User dapat coba lagi
  
  Jika UPDATE XP gagal:
  - ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
  - Log error untuk background job
  - Sinkronisasi nanti
end note

@enduml
